SYMATTR Value2 tc1=1.56e-3 tc2=6.10e-7
TEXT 32 976 Left 2 ;DAC core: 3 unary cells D1-D3 (16 x I_LSB) + 4 binary cells B3-B6 (8, 4, 2, 1 x I_LSB); unit PMOS W/L = 5u/3u, I_LSB = 2.3 uA. Each cell: source (VBP2) + cascode (VCP2) + PMOS switch pair; bit = 1 steers the current to IOUT, bit = 0 dumps it to analog ground. RDAC converts the summed current to the DAC voltage (12.5 mV/LSB).
